      "informal_statement": "Let $f : \\alpha \\to \\beta$ be a function and $l$ a filter on $\\alpha$. If $f$ tends to a point $x \\in \\beta$ along $l$ with respect to the principal filter at $x$, then $f$ is eventually constant along $l$."
